{{also|lein|Lein|LEIN}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|-elīn}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|-ilī}}, {{m|goh|-ilīn}}. In modern Standard German it is less common than, and often replaced by, {{term|-chen|lang=de}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=-lein}}</ref>

